    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s07-t03-drill-06-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第6题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s07-t03-drill-06",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（25联考）甲乙两辆车相距200米，同向同时沿直线出发，乙保持5米/秒的速度匀速前行，甲从速度为零起步做匀加速运动追赶乙，10秒后恰好追上乙，则甲在追上乙时的速度为：",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "10米/秒"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "30米/秒"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "50米/秒"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "70米/秒"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "C",
        "sourceAnswer": "C"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          78
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          72
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s07-t03-drill-06-p078.webp",
            "alt": "行程问题（二） · 实战精刷6 · 讲义第72页",
            "pdfPage": 78
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s07-t03-drill-06-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s07-t03-drill-06",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：C"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先看10秒内乙跑50米，甲原先还落后200米，所以甲追上时共跑250米，平均速度25米/秒。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "甲从静止匀加速，平均速度是末速度的一半，所以末速度50米/秒，选C。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "追赶先算快车实际走过的距离，再用匀加速首尾平均速度。"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
