    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s07-t03-drill-07-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第7题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s07-t03-drill-07",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（25选调）一辆汽车从A地开往B地，匀速行驶60%的路程后开始匀加速，又用了1小时到达B地，且到达时的速度最快，是出发时的2倍。问全程用了多长时间?",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "3小时"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "3小时15分钟"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "3小时25分钟"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "3小时30分钟"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "B",
        "sourceAnswer": "B"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          79
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          73
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s07-t03-drill-07-p079.webp",
            "alt": "行程问题（二） · 实战精刷7 · 讲义第73页",
            "pdfPage": 79
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s07-t03-drill-07-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s07-t03-drill-07",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：B"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们设出发速度v，后40%路程匀加速到2v，平均速度1.5v，用1小时，因此全程S满足0.4S＝1.5v。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "前60%路程为0.6S＝2.25v，按v匀速需要2.25小时，再加后面1小时，总3.25小时，即3小时15分，选B。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "匀加速段先用首尾平均速度定距离，再按路程比例回推匀速段。"
        }
      ],
