    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s07-t03-drill-08-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第8题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s07-t03-drill-08",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（23国考）甲和乙两人8：00同时从A地出发前往B地，其中乙全程匀速，甲出发时的速度是乙的一半，但全程均匀加速。已知10：00甲追上乙，11：00甲到达B地。问乙什么时间到达B地？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "12:15"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "12:00"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "11: 45"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "11: 30"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "C",
        "sourceAnswer": "C"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          79
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          73
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s07-t03-drill-08-p079.webp",
            "alt": "行程问题（二） · 实战精刷8 · 讲义第73页",
